  "derivation": "Each ID-less task's contentSignature hashes its exact UTF-8 JCS name with no trim, no NFC and no case folding, so U+E000, U+10000, a leading space, a leading NBSP and the bare name give five distinct signatures, each ordinal 0. Names are preserved. Source targetId is the nearest original ID-bearing ancestor, Process_uni. Report header (H B4): sourceIdentity and targetIdentity are the envelope identity, inputRevision is baseRevision, outputRevision is revision.",
